Subject: Verge Cold Chain - Larimer Street Cold Storage Buildout - ITB

Team,

Verge Cold Chain Holdings is issuing an invitation to bid for the Larimer
Street Cold Storage Buildout at our Denver, CO facility.

The package is refrigeration-led. Scope includes a low-temperature ammonia
refrigeration system serving four freezer rooms, the associated process piping,
and evaporator coil installation. There is a small amount of HVAC work for the
adjacent dock office but the controlling trade on this package is
refrigeration.

Trades required: refrigeration, piping, HVAC.

Engineer's estimate is $700,000.

Site walk is set for September 14, 2026. Bids close September 30, 2026.

Bonding: bid bond at 5%, performance and payment bonds at 100% each. GL limit
$1,000,000.

Construction window is April 5, 2027 through August 20, 2027.

Dmitri Vasconcelos-Ahn
Preconstruction Manager
Verge Cold Chain Holdings
